# Turn to Frog against Lord of Atlantis ("Other Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk"). On turn 2 Bot2 turns Bot1's Cenote
# Scout into a Frog: its creature types are replaced in layer 4 (CR 205.1a, the ruling), so by layer 6 it is no Merfolk and
# the Lord's effect does not reach it - a 1/1 with no islandwalk, not a 2/2. On turn 4, the Scout a Merfolk again (a 2/2
# with islandwalk), Bot2 turns the Lord itself into a Frog: the Lord loses its ability in layer 6, the ability's effect
# never begins (CR 613.8a), and the Scout is a 1/1 Merfolk with no islandwalk. The Lord is a 1/1 blue Frog.

